WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
Should homework...

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
...be abolished,

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
and we just make do with what we learn

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
at school, or not?

5
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Homework is necessary.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
What do you say, in one word?

7
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
No, of course!

8
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
I support homework.

9
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
You support it? And you, Talia?

10
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
I am against homework.

11
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
Yes — school exists

12
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
to be a place of learning,

13
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
not a station that hands the child half the knowledge

14
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
and sends the rest home with him.

15
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
The home is not a second classroom;

16
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
it is a space for family, rest and hobbies.

17
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Would you like to start building your idea straight away? Go ahead.

18
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Imagine with me, Mayar:

19
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
a child who wakes up early

20
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
and spends 7 hours

21
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
non-stop at school,

22
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
and then comes back home

23
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
and does not find his bed waiting for him,

24
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
or even time to play and rest —

25
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
instead he finds 3 hours waiting for him

26
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
of homework.

27
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
So when does he sleep? When does he rest?

28
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
When does he live his childhood?

29
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
A tired mind does not learn more,

30
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
and a body deprived

31
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
of sleep does not grow better.

32
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
We need a student

33
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
who studies with passion and focus,

34
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
not a student who carries his books to school

35
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
and comes home as if on a second shift.

36
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Mayar, what is your idea? What do you build?

37
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
I defend homework.

38
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
I have come to carry the voice of reason in our case,

39
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
to affirm that homework

40
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
is not a burden we fight to escape from;

41
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
it is the real bridge

42
00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
that fixes knowledge

43
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
and makes a responsible student

44
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
who builds the future.

45
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
I build my idea in 3 or 4 points.

46
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
First: the classroom is for explaining, and home is for consolidating.

47
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
Second: building character —

48
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
the responsible, competitive student.

49
00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Education is not just about grades;

50
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
it plants discipline and responsibility.

51
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Third: finding weak points,

52
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.500 line:3% align:center size:94%
and partnership with the family.

53
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Some see homework as a burden,

54
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
but I see it as a mirror.

55
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
Homework is

56
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000 line:3% align:center size:94%
the window that lets families

57
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.400 line:3% align:center size:94%
know their children's level before the exams.
